member.summary:
Ghost click-to-talk entry point for a spirit healer: adjacent → face + poke immediately;
otherwise walk to an adjacent stand tile and fire on arrival via
 (same shape as ).

Shared interact entry for E-key and click paths: quest-gated tiles are refused instantly
(server re-checks too); tiles with a GatherTimeMs start the channel and fire on completion;
everything else sends immediately.

Accepts an inventory item dragged onto the "Your Offer" grid. The cursor may land on a
slot or in a gap — snapped to the nearest offer slot, matching WoW-style behavior;
the server assigns the actual offer slot via the normal offer packet path.

Tile indices whose interactable object is currently collected (server-driven via
). Depleted tiles hide their label/highlight and
fade out any map objects overlapping them.
